The best to check out would be 'Dragons of Spring Dawning', 'War of
the Twins' and 'Test of the Twins' -- the final books in the original
Dragonlance Trilogy and the 2nd and 3rd books in the Twins Trilogy
respectively.  She gets the most speaking lines in the final books in
both, since those are obviously the parts where the ultimate villain
is encountered.  'War of the Twins' is also of interest because one of
our heroes winds up in the abyss and meets her for an interview on her
home plane.

